      "side": 1,
      "message": "The point of these _for_shared and _for_static properties is to handle static{} and shared{} stanzas respectively. \n\nPlease see cc_library_conversion_test.go for a more complete demonstration of this, but I\u0027ll point out specifically why we need Dynamic_deps and Dynamic_deps_for_shared:\n\n```\ncc_library {\n    name: \"a\",\n    shared_libs: [\"shared_dep_for_both\"], \n    static: {\n        shared_libs: [\"shared_dep_for_static\"],\n    },\n    shared: {\n        shared_libs: [\"shared_dep_for_shared\"],\n    },\n}\n```\n\ndynamic_deps that should be passed to cc_shared_library:\n`[\":shared_dep_for_both\", \":shared_dep_for_shared\"]`\n\nWhereas \"shared_dep_for_static\" are shared deps of the static library but *not* the shared library variant.",
